post_install() {
  cat <<EOF
For OpenRCT2 to run you must install the assets from a retail, GOG, or Steam
copy of RollerCoaster Tycoon 2 or RollerCoaster Tycoon Classic. See the following
page for more information on installing a retail copy of the game on Linux:

  https://github.com/OpenRCT2/OpenRCT2/wiki/Installation-on-Linux-and-macOS

If kdialog or zenity is available, OpenRCT2 will prompt you for the location of
the retail install the first time you start it.

Alternatively, manually set the location of retail install:

  openrct2 set-rct2 /path/to/RCT2/
EOF
}
